  <article class="article shell narrow prose">
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>How Ancient China Worked does not currently offer user accounts, comments, newsletters, contact forms, or direct payment. We do not ask visitors to provide personal information through the site.</p>
    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider may process limited technical information needed to deliver pages and protect the service, such as IP address, browser type, and request logs. We do not use that information to identify individual readers.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and search tools</h2>
    <p>We use Google Search Console to understand how Google discovers and displays public pages. It provides aggregated search-performance information to the site owner; it does not give us individual visitors’ identities.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>Articles may link to publishers, libraries, booksellers, museums, or other external sites. Their privacy practices are their own, and you should review their policies before providing them with personal information.</p>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this page when site features, analytics, advertising, or affiliate relationships change. The date above will be updated when a material revision is made.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
